      "topic": "staff",
      "title": {
        "en": "Supportive and professional clinical staff"
      },
      "text": {
        "en": "Pet owners broadly commend the veterinarians and nursing assistants for their compassionate, knowledgeable approach and clear medical explanations. Many clients highlight Dr. Pappas and Dr. T for their reassuring bedside manner. While one reviewer reported a frustrating encounter with a technician during a blood draw, the vast majority describe the team as dedicated and respectful."
      },
      "mentions": 32,
      "sentiment": "positive"
    },
    {
      "topic": "animals",
      "title": {
        "en": "Patient care for anxious pets"
      },
      "text": {
        "en": "Clients frequently note how gentle and attentive the staff is with frightened, senior, or previously abused animals. Reviewers appreciate that clinicians take extra time to keep dogs and cats relaxed during consultations, vaccinations, and surgical procedures, creating a low-stress environment that puts both pets and their owners at ease."
      },
      "mentions": 30,
      "sentiment": "positive"
    },
    {
      "topic": "results",
      "title": {
        "en": "Successful treatments and surgical care"
      },
      "text": {
        "en": "Many reviews report excellent clinical outcomes for complex surgeries, dental procedures, and sudden medical issues. Pet owners praise the veterinary team for their accurate diagnostic evaluations, thorough follow-up care, and effective treatment plans that help animals recover comfortably and regain their vitality."
      },
      "mentions": 22,
      "sentiment": "positive"
    }
  ],
